[I] Tool to run Kubernetes locally

[T] minikube implements a local Kubernetes cluster. minikube's primary goals
[T] are to be the best tool for local Kubernetes application development and to
[T] support all Kubernetes features that fit.

[U] https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/

[A] Kubernetes Developers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[L] APL
[V] 1.39.0

[D] 41a4d922541c9cd0e74fd6f2ce821b68111f4cbce49064418f0a1cc5 minikube-1.39.0.tar.gz https://github.com/kubernetes/minikube/archive/v1.39.0/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

var_append goconfopt ' ' "-o build/ ./cmd/{auto-pause,extract,gvisor,minikube,storage-provisioner}"
hook_add postmake 5 "cp -vf build/* $root$bindir/"
